cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas este software en tu investigación, por favor cítalo."
title: "Scholarly Profile Auditor: bibliographic audit with SNII Cita A/B classification"
abstract: >-
  Local-first software for reproducible bibliographic auditing of researcher
  profiles. Integrates ORCID, OpenAlex, Crossref, DataCite, arXiv and Semantic
  Scholar through a guided three-step workflow (author identification,
  publication confirmation, citation analysis). Classifies citations as Cita A
  (strictly external) or Cita B (excludes only the evaluated author's
  self-citations) following the official criteria of Mexico's Sistema Nacional
  de Investigadoras e Investigadores (SNII), Area I.
type: software
authors:
